WEBVTT

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:05.500
Everyone, when you're watching Deltora Quest,

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:09.400
make sure you're in a well-lit
room and sit far away from the TV!

00:00:17.830 --> 00:00:24.040
You are my sun now

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:28.460
We all go through bad times

00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:31.460
no matter who you are

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:36.890
So don't go hanging your head and feeling down

00:00:38.930 --> 00:00:45.640
Keep your head up until your heart's sky

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:51.030
is clear again

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:56.360
No matter where you are in this world

00:00:56.360 --> 00:00:59.870
if you're crying and trembling all alone

00:00:59.870 --> 00:01:05.210
I'll search for you, I promise

00:01:05.410 --> 00:01:08.880
Love will show me the way

00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:16.760
The sun dreams countless times

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:23.560
Forever and always from the horizon

00:01:24.180 --> 00:01:30.900
Its shining light gives energy

00:01:31.940 --> 00:01:38.240
After all, you are my sun now

00:01:56.170 --> 00:01:57.700
<i>My name is Lief.</i>

00:01:57.700 --> 00:02:02.680
<i>I'm travelling with Jasmine and Barda to take back the gems that were stolen by the Shadow Lord.</i>

00:02:02.680 --> 00:02:04.660
<i>And there are only two gems left!</i>

00:02:04.660 --> 00:02:10.920
<i>However, the Shadow Lord is now hunting for a boy, a man and a wild girl with a black bird.</i>

00:02:10.920 --> 00:02:15.310
<i>Why am I the 'wild one', anyway?
Honestly, the Shadow Lord has no taste.</i>

00:02:16.380 --> 00:02:19.210
<i>Our journey is sure to become
more perilous from now on!</i>

00:02:19.710 --> 00:02:24.610
<i>Right now, we're headed to the Maze of the Beast, where the sixth gem is hidden!</i>

00:02:33.270 --> 00:02:37.780
I'll say it once more. We have failed.

00:02:37.780 --> 00:02:39.410
So let's just end it here.

00:02:39.410 --> 00:02:40.790
But...

00:02:42.640 --> 00:02:45.800
You've both done well to get this far.

00:02:46.210 --> 00:02:51.690
But now that the Belt is gone, there's no
reason to continue this journey any further.

00:03:02.290 --> 00:03:03.000
Barda!

00:03:09.290 --> 00:03:11.390
There are two Bardas...?!

00:03:14.830 --> 00:03:18.350
Don't be deceived, Lief! He's an impostor!

00:03:18.350 --> 00:03:21.010
What nonsense! You're the impostor here!

00:03:21.010 --> 00:03:22.990
This guy is an Ol in disguise!

00:03:24.910 --> 00:03:27.280
Hurry up and beat this faker, Lief!

00:03:29.170 --> 00:03:31.990
What are you waiting for, Lief?!
We have to defeat him!

00:03:31.990 --> 00:03:33.220
U-Uhh...

00:03:33.520 --> 00:03:36.330
Try to ask those Bardas a question, Lief.

00:03:36.330 --> 00:03:37.300
A question?

00:03:37.300 --> 00:03:40.640
Something that only the real
Barda can know the answer to.

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:42.100
Got it!

00:03:43.060 --> 00:03:46.420
Barda! Tell me the name of the
girl who is with us here!

00:03:46.900 --> 00:03:47.770
Jasmine!

00:03:46.900 --> 00:03:47.770
-Jasmine!

00:03:48.100 --> 00:03:49.000
Oh, wait...

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:50.500
That's way too obvious...

00:03:51.060 --> 00:03:53.870
Tell me, where is our next destination?

00:03:53.870 --> 00:03:56.020
Do you think I can just reveal that to the enemy?!

00:03:53.870 --> 00:03:56.020
-Do you think I can just reveal that to the enemy?!

00:03:56.020 --> 00:03:57.200
O-Oh, right...

00:03:58.900 --> 00:04:01.700
Then, tell me my parents' names!

00:04:14.020 --> 00:04:15.220
Ken and Marie!

00:04:15.420 --> 00:04:17.980
The correct answer is... Jarred and Anna!

00:04:39.910 --> 00:04:40.730
Barda!

00:04:40.730 --> 00:04:41.590
Are you okay?

00:04:41.590 --> 00:04:42.390
Yeah.

00:04:45.900 --> 00:04:47.890
That guy... from the ferry?!

00:04:50.220 --> 00:04:51.700
So he was an Ol, then...

00:04:56.970 --> 00:05:00.260
That Ol probably thought
that I died in the river.

00:05:01.160 --> 00:05:04.410
When I finally got to land
and followed your tracks,

00:05:04.410 --> 00:05:06.850
I saw another me together with you two.

00:05:08.370 --> 00:05:09.650
I knew it.

00:05:10.300 --> 00:05:14.490
I knew something was off when you
wanted to end our journey so easily.

00:05:14.990 --> 00:05:19.370
You were even making lame puns,
and trying to act all cool.

00:05:22.030 --> 00:05:24.460
Anyway, let's get out of here.

00:05:26.400 --> 00:05:29.350
While I may not be very 'cool',

00:05:29.350 --> 00:05:34.050
I'm definitely not a man who will give up
on our journey just because we lost the belt.

00:05:34.050 --> 00:05:38.860
It wasn't just the Belt that we lost, though;
we also lost all of the gems we had gathered...

00:05:39.600 --> 00:05:42.640
I'm sure they're already far
away from this place.

00:05:43.070 --> 00:05:46.070
You never know. They might
still be nearby, you know?

00:05:46.070 --> 00:05:49.840
We have fought countless
dreadful monsters before now.

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:56.100
By comparison, fighting some
bandits will be a simple task, right?

00:05:57.460 --> 00:05:58.300
Barda...

00:05:58.860 --> 00:06:02.460
That's true. As long as the three
of us fight as one, we'll be fine!

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:03.470
Exactly.

00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:06.750
Alright then, let's look for those bandits!

00:06:07.090 --> 00:06:08.720
So you guys want a fight, huh?

00:06:13.240 --> 00:06:13.800
Lief!

00:06:14.020 --> 00:06:14.600
Lief!

00:06:14.950 --> 00:06:17.000
You really are taking us for fools, aren't you?

00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:19.800
But if it's a fight you want,
we'll be glad to oblige.

00:06:22.180 --> 00:06:23.260
Ow, that hurts!!

00:06:23.500 --> 00:06:24.660
Make it stop.

00:06:25.250 --> 00:06:26.520
Kree, stop it!

00:06:28.260 --> 00:06:32.020
Well then, I believe we no
longer have to fight, do we?

00:06:40.590 --> 00:06:44.860
Come to think of it, you kicked me
back on that ship, didn't you?

00:06:44.860 --> 00:06:49.720
I think I'll teach you a lesson on what
happens when you treat your elders so rudely.

00:06:49.720 --> 00:06:52.370
This is where the real fun begins.

00:06:52.900 --> 00:06:54.090
That's my belt!

00:06:54.520 --> 00:06:57.510
Ah, so you were looking
for this belt, were you?

00:06:58.010 --> 00:07:00.720
Certainly, this is one hell of a nice belt.

00:07:00.720 --> 00:07:04.100
But you see, I don't think you'll
be needing it anymore.

00:07:32.680 --> 00:07:35.940
Don't follow us, Kree! Stay there!

00:07:35.940 --> 00:07:37.580
Yeah, for eternity that is!

00:08:05.560 --> 00:08:06.340
Polipan!

00:08:09.080 --> 00:08:12.510
Guys, look at what I brought back!

00:08:17.040 --> 00:08:18.860
Behave yourselves and stay there!

00:08:20.260 --> 00:08:20.920
Lief!

00:08:22.650 --> 00:08:23.460
Dain!

00:08:23.460 --> 00:08:24.310
Are you alright?

00:08:24.310 --> 00:08:24.930
Yeah.

00:08:25.620 --> 00:08:30.020
I knew that you guys were still alive,
and that you'd come and save me.

00:08:30.020 --> 00:08:33.300
Well, getting captured does save us
the effort of looking for you.

00:08:34.450 --> 00:08:37.170
Now then, what should we do with them?

00:08:37.410 --> 00:08:39.200
Let's kill them already!

00:08:42.910 --> 00:08:44.650
Now wait just a moment.

00:08:44.650 --> 00:08:48.400
Doing that would mean that we brought
them all the way here for nothing, right?

00:08:48.400 --> 00:08:49.930
That's Milne.

00:08:50.240 --> 00:08:52.990
He was the one who kidnapped
me from the ferry.

00:08:52.990 --> 00:08:53.750
Milne...

00:08:54.460 --> 00:08:55.690
You there...

00:08:56.770 --> 00:09:00.900
You're a Resistance member, aren't you?
Let's hand him over to the Grey Guards.

00:09:01.050 --> 00:09:02.050
What did you say?!

00:09:02.400 --> 00:09:06.720
Doom wouldn't let us off easy
if we sold out the Resistance!

00:09:06.720 --> 00:09:07.980
That's right!

00:09:07.980 --> 00:09:12.810
He'd definitely find and kill anyone who
crossed him, no matter how long it took!

00:09:12.810 --> 00:09:16.110
Are lot really that scared of
Doom, you spineless fools?

00:09:16.540 --> 00:09:17.380
What was that?!

00:09:17.380 --> 00:09:22.540
How can you guys call yourselves bandits when you're
so afraid of the Grey Guards and the Resistance?!

00:09:22.540 --> 00:09:27.900
But then again, I suppose if you guys <i>were</i> to fight
Doom, you'd just be crushed in seconds anyway.

00:09:29.280 --> 00:09:30.500
You shut your mouth!

00:09:35.570 --> 00:09:37.390
What's the matter, Jasmine?

00:09:37.720 --> 00:09:39.900
I'm thinking about Doom.

00:09:39.900 --> 00:09:42.050
Remember when I fought him before?

00:09:42.930 --> 00:09:45.940
I finally understand what's
so frightening about him now.

00:09:46.440 --> 00:09:49.000
He doesn't fear death; not one bit.

00:09:49.610 --> 00:09:55.380
He probably experienced something very traumatic in the
past, and it didn't just scar his face, but also his heart...

00:09:56.580 --> 00:10:01.300
He doesn't have anything to lose. That's
probably the secret behind Doom's strength.

00:10:02.700 --> 00:10:06.500
But, I don't want that kind
of strength. Not ever.

00:10:08.650 --> 00:10:10.110
Cut it out already!!

00:10:11.120 --> 00:10:12.770
H-Hey, give me a break will you?!

00:10:12.770 --> 00:10:14.730
Heh, all bark and no bite.

00:10:14.730 --> 00:10:17.130
Ganging up on me... that's cowardly!!

00:10:17.470 --> 00:10:19.800
Call us cowards all you like.

00:10:19.800 --> 00:10:21.700
It's a lot better than being dead.

00:10:21.950 --> 00:10:25.620
I think we'll feed you to the Glus as well, Milne.

00:10:25.620 --> 00:10:26.700
The Glus...?!

00:10:27.150 --> 00:10:28.590
Yeah, along with that lot.

00:10:28.590 --> 00:10:33.100
Nice idea! Let's make Milne and the three
who he brought into the Glus' food!

00:10:33.370 --> 00:10:37.600
And then we can hand that Resistance
member over to the Grey Guards.

00:10:37.890 --> 00:10:40.530
Of course; it'll make us
some good coin, after all.

00:10:40.860 --> 00:10:43.350
We should also say that Milne
was the one who did it.

00:10:43.350 --> 00:10:46.560
That way, we'll have no need
to fear Doom harming us.

00:10:46.560 --> 00:10:50.300
Finn! So you <i>can</i> come up with
good ideas every once in a while!

00:10:50.700 --> 00:10:53.370
Alright! Let's get it done with after the sun sets!

00:10:53.980 --> 00:10:57.960
Please! You can do whatever you want with
me, but please don't feed me to the Glus!!

00:10:57.960 --> 00:11:00.760
I wonder what this 'Glus' is...

00:11:00.760 --> 00:11:04.600
Whatever it is, it seems to be enough to make a grown man tremble in fear.

00:11:39.030 --> 00:11:44.120
So Dain will be handed over to the
Grey Guards once night falls...

00:11:44.120 --> 00:11:46.920
And we will become food for this 'Glus'.

00:11:46.920 --> 00:11:49.700
We need to do something
before it comes to that.

00:11:49.700 --> 00:11:51.540
If only we weren't tied up...

00:11:53.660 --> 00:11:55.670
What now? I don't have anything on me!

00:11:57.430 --> 00:11:58.800
Go someplace else!

00:12:01.120 --> 00:12:04.450
Oh, I see. You want my
caramel candy, don't you?

00:12:08.950 --> 00:12:11.940
Do you guys think you could
distract the bandits for a while?

00:12:12.900 --> 00:12:16.100
I've got a plan which might
get us the Belt back.

00:12:18.220 --> 00:12:19.400
Alright.

00:12:23.920 --> 00:12:25.960
Could we perform something as well?

00:12:27.480 --> 00:12:31.230
And if it's entertaining, please
promise to spare our lives!

00:12:31.230 --> 00:12:35.140
I see... Sure, if you can entertain us, that is.

00:12:35.140 --> 00:12:36.500
Let's see what you've got.

00:12:38.560 --> 00:12:40.850
Come, Barda. That's your cue.

00:12:40.850 --> 00:12:43.500
What... You want <i>me</i> to do this?!

00:12:43.500 --> 00:12:46.420
Are you really going to let a
girl embarrass herself here?

00:12:46.420 --> 00:12:47.580
But why me?

00:12:48.880 --> 00:12:50.690
We're counting on you, Barda!

00:12:53.130 --> 00:12:54.160
Fine, I'll do it!

00:12:54.160 --> 00:12:55.680
Untie him.

00:13:17.650 --> 00:13:19.200
Polipan impression!

00:13:27.060 --> 00:13:30.420
You fool! I even got my
expectations up a little!

00:13:31.400 --> 00:13:33.640
Just as I thought, he's better off dead!

00:13:34.780 --> 00:13:36.840
I still think it was pretty good, though...

00:13:44.200 --> 00:13:45.680
The Belt of Deltora...!

00:13:45.680 --> 00:13:48.100
Good boy! Now wrap it around my waist!

00:13:49.320 --> 00:13:53.960
Come on, I know you're a good boy.
You want your reward, don't you?

00:13:55.640 --> 00:13:57.590
I'm surprised it's being this obedient.

00:14:03.720 --> 00:14:06.470
That's just how much these
guys love caramel candy.

00:14:08.080 --> 00:14:09.160
Now then...

00:14:10.380 --> 00:14:13.200
It's about time to throw out
the garbage, isn't it?

00:14:13.200 --> 00:14:15.200
I happen to be quite diligent.

00:14:17.030 --> 00:14:18.330
Hey, watch it!

00:14:19.270 --> 00:14:24.660
No!! L-Let me go! I beg you! Please don't!

00:14:21.580 --> 00:14:24.000
Lief! Barda! Jamine!!

00:14:31.500 --> 00:14:34.060
H-Hey! Cut it out guys!

00:14:34.060 --> 00:14:37.380
You were just joking, right?!
We're comrades, aren't we?!

00:14:38.330 --> 00:14:39.390
Please, stop!!

00:14:41.930 --> 00:14:44.400
Stop this! No! Somebody save me!!

00:14:45.420 --> 00:14:47.680
I'm begging you! Please spare me!!

00:14:49.920 --> 00:14:51.700
I've cut the rope for you.

00:14:52.050 --> 00:14:54.700
It won't be much fun if
you die quickly, after all.

00:14:57.010 --> 00:14:57.980
Barda! Jasmine!

00:15:01.210 --> 00:15:03.200
Send my regards to the Glus, won't you?

00:15:21.030 --> 00:15:21.860
Lief!

00:15:22.700 --> 00:15:23.600
Over here!

00:15:26.090 --> 00:15:27.200
Are you okay?

00:15:27.200 --> 00:15:28.100
Yeah, and you guys?

00:15:28.100 --> 00:15:29.000
We're fine.

00:15:31.620 --> 00:15:32.520
Milne...

00:15:43.530 --> 00:15:45.700
It's coming... The Glus is coming!

00:15:47.100 --> 00:15:48.590
Filli seems nervous too...

00:15:49.080 --> 00:15:51.200
Anyway, let's get out of this place.

00:16:05.680 --> 00:16:09.000
The sound keeps getting
closer! It's catching up to us!

00:16:09.000 --> 00:16:10.620
Do we have no choice but to fight it?!

00:16:10.620 --> 00:16:12.930
Fight the Glus?! It'll be the death of you!!

00:16:13.410 --> 00:16:15.040
Just what kind of monster is it?!

00:16:15.040 --> 00:16:15.710
It's...

00:16:17.450 --> 00:16:18.720
Are you alright?

00:16:18.720 --> 00:16:20.160
S-Shit...!

00:16:20.510 --> 00:16:23.000
What did I do to deserve this...?!

00:16:24.810 --> 00:16:27.910
Barda, Milne, hurry up! It's almost here!!

00:17:06.190 --> 00:17:07.800
So that's the Glus, huh...

00:17:08.270 --> 00:17:09.700
What in the world <i>is</i> that...?

00:17:10.820 --> 00:17:14.590
I see...! So this place is the Maze of the Beast!

00:17:33.260 --> 00:17:34.000
Jasmine!

00:17:36.430 --> 00:17:37.860
I can't move...!

00:17:37.860 --> 00:17:39.000
Stay still!

00:17:47.100 --> 00:17:48.850
Get up, hurry!

00:17:49.100 --> 00:17:51.340
How?! I can't get free!!

00:17:51.640 --> 00:17:55.200
Barda, go and help Jasmine free Milne!

00:17:55.200 --> 00:17:56.000
Right!

00:17:56.340 --> 00:17:58.310
Hey, over here!!

00:17:58.310 --> 00:18:01.300
Come on! I'm over here you
know?! What's the matter?!

00:18:01.000 --> 00:18:03.100
It hurts! It hurts!!

00:18:03.620 --> 00:18:04.720
Be quiet, Milne!

00:18:07.240 --> 00:18:08.510
I told you to look here!!

00:18:17.820 --> 00:18:20.450
It fricking hurts!! You'll rip my arm off!!

00:18:20.450 --> 00:18:21.670
Don't make a sound!

00:18:57.700 --> 00:19:00.440
It loses sight of us once we go quiet...?

00:19:03.350 --> 00:19:04.200
Don't move.

00:19:05.000 --> 00:19:06.100
Just stay still.

00:19:09.140 --> 00:19:11.220
Just observe it quietly for now.

00:19:32.390 --> 00:19:33.530
Stay still.

00:20:40.220 --> 00:20:45.490
The Glus' eyesight has probably deteriorated
from having lived in this cavern all this time.

00:20:45.490 --> 00:20:47.950
It may even be completely blind by now.

00:20:47.950 --> 00:20:51.550
At any rate, we need to find
some way out of this cavern!

00:20:51.990 --> 00:20:54.440
Where could the exit be, I wonder.

00:20:54.910 --> 00:20:57.100
Well don't ask me!

00:20:57.100 --> 00:20:59.920
This is <i>your</i> people's hideout, isn't it?
Don't you know where the exit is?

00:20:59.920 --> 00:21:01.890
I don't know where it is either...!!

00:21:01.890 --> 00:21:02.610
Geez...

00:21:03.260 --> 00:21:04.460
What should we do?

00:21:05.820 --> 00:21:08.400
Hey Jasmine, you still
have your dagger, right?

00:21:15.230 --> 00:21:16.580
That looks expensive...

00:21:19.360 --> 00:21:23.640
<i>The topaz, the gem that is
strongest during the full moon,</i>

00:21:23.640 --> 00:21:27.620
<i>is said to sharpen and clear
the mind of its wielder.</i>

00:21:28.560 --> 00:21:33.380
If this place really is the Maze of the Beast,
then the sixth gem should be here somewhere too.

00:21:33.780 --> 00:21:37.850
You really want to look for it with that monster
lurking around?! It's too dangerous!

00:21:37.850 --> 00:21:42.360
The entire point of our quest is
to find all of the gems, isn't it?

00:21:42.360 --> 00:21:43.180
But...!

00:21:43.180 --> 00:21:44.300
That's right.

00:21:45.300 --> 00:21:46.600
We must follow the Belt.

00:21:47.400 --> 00:21:48.520
Fine then!

00:21:53.570 --> 00:21:55.200
Where could the gem be...

00:21:59.040 --> 00:22:00.340
A dead-end?

00:22:04.800 --> 00:22:08.500
The belt is getting hot! It must be
somewhere close; just around here...!

00:22:11.370 --> 00:22:12.400
It's him!

00:22:22.830 --> 00:22:25.000
The Glus is coming...!

00:22:38.500 --> 00:22:47.760
How long has it truly been, I wonder?

00:22:47.760 --> 00:22:57.640
I've been watching the moon all this time, bathing in its light

00:22:57.640 --> 00:23:05.070
As we moved closer, a goddess passed over us

00:23:05.070 --> 00:23:14.780
And just like that, my little dream was carried away

00:23:15.620 --> 00:23:20.460
I saw you when I looked to the night sky

00:23:20.410 --> 00:23:25.040
Now that I think of it, your name was written there too

00:23:25.710 --> 00:23:29.300
Above me, a shooting star

00:23:29.300 --> 00:23:32.720
fades into the distance

00:23:33.840 --> 00:23:38.390
When the moonlight starts to wane

00:23:38.390 --> 00:23:43.060
I stand under the lazy morning's light

00:23:43.980 --> 00:23:47.400
And when that same moon rises

00:23:47.400 --> 00:23:56.200
I'll start moving all over again

00:24:06.870 --> 00:24:08.000
<i>The Jalis.</i>

00:24:08.930 --> 00:24:12.050
<i>A tribe of skilled warriors with violent tempers.</i>

00:24:12.570 --> 00:24:17.040
<i>It is said that they fought valiantly to
protect the kingdom and died out</i>

00:24:17.040 --> 00:24:19.220
<i>during the first invasion
of the Shadow Lord.</i>

00:24:20.520 --> 00:24:26.920
The Glus kept pursuing us, taking its time and
waiting for its chance to strike once we grew tired.

00:24:27.190 --> 00:24:30.500
Are we destined to meet our
ends in this dark place?!

00:24:30.820 --> 00:24:34.740
